        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "PMpP4",
          "x": 80,
          "y": 86,
          "fill": "#FCE492",
          "content": "什么是创伤反应？",
          "textAlign": "center",
          "fontFamily": "Inter, sans-serif",
          "fontSize": 80,
          "fontWeight": "bold",
          "letterSpacing": 4
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "0t29o",
          "x": 80,
          "y": 240,
          "fill": "#FFFFFFFF",
          "content": "它不是软弱，也不是矫情，\n而来自大脑深处的保护机制——\n那些曾经帮你活下来的本能反应，\n在危险过去后，依然在运行。",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Inter, sans-serif",
          "fontSize": 48,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "V8slo",
          "x": 80,
          "y": 656,
          "width": 920,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 24,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "d8CwC",
              "fill": "#FCE492",
              "content": "📖  心理学中这样描述它：",
              "fontFamily": "Inter, sans-serif",
              "fontSize": 40,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "fzd91",
              "fill": "#FFFFFFFF",
              "content": "当个体遭遇超出承受能力的事件后，\n神经系统产生的持续性应激反应。\n它可能表现为闪回、回避、\n过度警觉或情绪麻木。",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "Inter, sans-serif",
              "fontSize": 46,
              "fontWeight": "bold",
              "letterSpacing": 1
            }
          ]
        },
